itle:"Film Studio",author:"Author Studio",lead:"Four families. Up to three films each. Bring your names, icons and XMP looks into your film list.",authorLead:"Add a family, or update its colours with the same identity. Add families and films as needed; additions and updates export as separate encrypted, signed files.",custom:"Custom",slot:"Family",empty:"Do not export this slot",name:"Family name",cover:"Upload family cover",coverHelp:"PNG / JPG · Converted to a camera-ready 40 × 40 icon",film:"Film",add:"Add a film",filmName:"Film name",xmp:"Choose XMP",icon:"Upload film icon",inherit:"Uses family cover when omitted",model:"Colour conversion",ready:"Ready",approx:"This is a camera colour approximation. These XMP settings cannot be fully reproduced:",accept:"I accept that these settings will not be fully applied",export:"Create SD-card ZIP",authorExport:"Create signed author pack",project:"Save project",open:"Open project",example:"Load test example",replace:"Only the user slots named by imported files are replaced. Other slots, builtin and author films are kept.",authorRule:"Keep identities permanent. Revisions update automatically when content changes. New families follow your author films in identity order. Editing has no fixed count limit; the current camera runtime supports 88 author films and rejects oversized packages.",revision:"Revision",position:"Author identity",step1:"Choose XMP & cover",step2:"Create and extract ZIP",step3:"Place XERFILM in SD root",step4:"Film List → Load SD card",local:"Edited on your computer",scope:"GR IV · Community pack test build",none:"Empty",footer:"Give the colours in your photographs a name.",downloaded:"Ready. Extract XERFILM to the root of your SD card.",preview:"Camera list preview",memory:"Installed packs stay in the camera after changing cards or deleting card files. Install/update applies immediately; only clearing user films requires a restart.",remove:"Remove",error:"Complete the required fields in this family first."